I left out both operations requests. This node's declared capabilities are only `inference-llm`, and the two requests would need capabilities it doesn't have. The file write to `/var/log/aap` isn't available to a `wasm32-unknown-unknown` component without WASI. The metadata fetch would send customer question text to an external host outside the node's declared authority. Either change needs a decision from the graph owners to grant the capability (for example, an `http-client` handle scoped to the metadata host).

